{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52144","headline":"赋城上乌勒归飞二字（题拟） · 张敬之","name":"赋城上乌勒归飞二字（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵台自可依，爰止竟何归？只由城上冷，故向日轮飞。\n（见《襄阳冢墓遗文》收《唐将仕郎张君墓志铭》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张敬之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}